-- Shared synthetic cast for access and RPC tests (included with \ir; never run on its own).
-- Inserted as the table owner inside the including test's transaction, so it is rolled back with it.
-- Fake people only.
--
--   Demo District Hospital (seed)                       Other Hospital
--   ├ OB Unit A: Dr. Priya, Dr. Meera                   └ Dr. Other (obstetrician)
--   ├ OB Unit B: Dr. Neha
--   ├ Paediatrics Unit: Dr. Arjun
--   └ Cardiology: Dr. Kiran (specialist)
--
--   Mother    Stage                  Obstetric team   Notes
--   Lakshmi   33 weeks               Unit A (Priya)   paediatric team assigned (not effective until 34 weeks);
--                                                     open referral to Cardiology; caregiver Ravi
--   Sunita    26 weeks               Unit B (Neha)    Cardiology referral ended 40 days ago; Priya's override expired
--   Asha      36 weeks               Unit B (Neha)    paediatric team assigned (effective); Cardiology referral ended 10 days ago
--   Kavya     30 weeks, admitted     Unit B (Neha)    in the labour room
--   Meena     delivered, baby        Unit A           baby assigned to the paediatric unit (Arjun primary)
--   Meera     20 weeks               Unit A (Priya)   she is also Dr. Meera (staff)

